    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Megane Tessier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117507795827610264214/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIQs0T0V2oH8M-K9BoN2pyZoh_oKJJGGL_sObxkuLXZk78r-A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Such a great experience! The staff is so nice and friendly. They take your jacket, and offer you a coffee. The boutique has such cute things to buy. The ultrasound room is so cozy and cute! I recommend this place to everyone. Will definitely be coming back 🙂",
        "time": 1769013249,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kristal Swope",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107009943135412665318/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIdcofbH8gSHwl2EUkzRVS4TR8mG0GKePw6wuJctdigKSDSsQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We did a 3D/4D ultrasound at Institut MAIA earlier today and had a wonderful experience! The photos turned out great and the ultrasound technician was very friendly. The shop itself is really cute and fully stocked with all sorts of pregnancy and postpartum items.  I would highly recommend!",
        "time": 1757788732,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Diana Ambrosi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112145488732277779369/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIqCJ7m8DK09C4wvDKaXPzScNCaztM7K1eGJ_tfCzk34gm34A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had a really nice experience here. The place itself feels like a spa and is so nicely done. The receptionist and the ultrasound tech were both welcoming and warm. We had a hard time getting pictures of my baby’s face because of his position but the tech managed to do so with patience. I was told if they couldn’t get the pictures, I could go back free of charge which was appreciated. They give you a small bag of cookies, a little plant and a USB key with all the pictures + the printouts that are part of your package. Overall, I recommend this place and experience.",
        "time": 1730403338,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Paula Keuylian",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104871260734236093790/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWuSIfp4BDGpy_e_tKEsmJJgHWF0mc5NQ8xA5E_TWRYPfAX0kwZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had an appointment on Monday but they got a call from Hydro that they won’t get any electricity. Instead of taking us later (they were going on vacation as of Tuesday) they booked all the families on the weekend. They were AMAZING. This is my second pregnancy so second experience at Institut Maia and honestly, THE BEST. No complaints. I even had to bring my two very LOUD and disruptive kids and they were so nice and didn’t mind having them around.\nI recommend them all day everyday!!!",
        "time": 1731862428,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anne Marie Tabao",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107836735859688949213/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKskGNtTl5JDGwZ8dg_G1NyZqkASukAPqtaniwIcfk9fwwc7w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I'm so happy to have found a local place that sells maternity leggings on top of all of their other services. I love their little shop and can't wait to buy more things! Service was great and I'm excited to wear the leggings I bought. They are the softest and comfiest I've ever tried!\nThanks for the great service and see you in a few weeks to find out the gender of my baby 😊",
        "time": 1708634988,
        "translated": false
      }
